# This directory is content, not build output. It used to ignore everything,
# which quietly broke the one workflow the site is built around: a PDF dropped
# in here was skipped by `git add` without a word, and only the 174 files that
# had been force-added once stayed tracked.
#
# PDFs and the folders that hold them are tracked. Anything else — a stray
# download, an editor temp file — still is not.
*
!.gitignore
!.gitkeep
!*/
!*.pdf
!*.PDF
